SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance LIVE Music w/ Trey Crispin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 8th\nEvening Dance
  Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nLIVE M
 usic w/ Trey Crispin\, Alex Caruso & DJ Mikaya\n\nIntention: Come and let 
 yourself be danced\n\nLeave your busy mind at the door next to the pile of
  expectations and judgements you may have about your dance this evening. T
 hen approach this dance floor as the endless expanse for expression and co
 nnection that it is. You have made it\, you showed up. Now join us in conn
 ecting to the art of live music and dancers breathing and moving together 
 in the practice of Dance. Let this awareness move you into your body's lan
 guage for this moment and see what it has to offer. Come and let yourself 
 be danced.\n\nAbout the Band\nTrey Crispin\nAlexander Caruso\nDJ Mikaya (M
 icah Swabb) is a facilitator at AMC and creator of dance waves with many s
 tyles and flavors within the Ecstatic Dance realm. His deejay skill has sp
 anned over two decades covering many ecstatic dance containers\, festivals
 \, sound healing events and yoga classes. You can listen to his catalog of
  over 80 mixes and mashups at http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb.\n\n\\~\\~
 \\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors clos
 e promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. P
 lease be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Pri
 ces: $25-50 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPr
 e-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/..
 ./djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../?f
 bclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMj
 AzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9
 kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volu
 nteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemov
 ementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/vo
 lunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBw
 X2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2
 I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\n
 Door will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO EN
 TRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://a
 shevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollec
 tive.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0R
 XNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_L
 MLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsh
 eville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where a
 ll are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mi
 ssion and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through fr
 ee-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transforma
 tion. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\,
  Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
