SUMMARY:AMC Sunday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ SeigeA
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nSunday\, May 10th\n1st Dance Wa
 ve 8:30\\-10:30am \\| Warmup 8:30am \\| Opening Circle 9am\n2nd Dance Wave
  10:30\\-12:30am \\| Warmup 10:30am \\| Opening Circle 11am\nDJ SeigeA\n\n
 Intention: Intention: Adapt-Ability\n\nHow do we develop the ability to ad
 apt?\nIs it through attunement\, stability\, flexibility\, or?\nWhat does 
 it mean to adapt mentally? Physically? Socially?\nHow does your dance adap
 t to the music\, the space\, your partner\, your body?\n\nImage is from Go
 Go Penguin's Everything Is Going to Be OK album cover.\n\nAbout the DJ\nDJ
  SeigeA (CJ O'Reilly) has been creating ecstatic dance waves for the Ashev
 ille community since 2014. Their eclectic mix of musical styles beckons da
 ncers into new patterns of movement and expression through diverse time si
 gnatures and instrumentation\, and a wide range of musical and emotive qua
 lities. CJ's waves explore high peaks\, beautiful vistas\, juicy lowlands 
 and the profound reflective stillness of tranquil water. CJ's dance waves 
 are pre-produced and refined through the body and ears of a dancer and aud
 iophile. Find more of DJ SeigeA's dance waves at [https://dj.seigea.com](h
 ttps://dj.seigea.com/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExUEw3a0M1OVdXaXZBT2R
 YVnNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR7_kLZb02C0GtEJZq7DNA0VDNNL4tpCK
 WsNg1SWy5-UKvBESv4lXcjFt4AnpA_aem_MZ9LvDpfu8arWQ_ujtMuiA)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n
 \\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promp
 tly at Opening Circle and people who arrive late will be turned away. Plea
 se be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\n\nTicket Pric
 e: $15-30 or name your price.\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\n\n\\
 ~\\~\\~\n\nPre-registration Recommended:\nhttps://ashevillemovementcollect
 ive.org/event/\n\nVOLUNTEER!\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for 
 free! Register to volunteer at: [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/v
 olunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh
 0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyM
 DA4OTIAAR6puHJaet_dJGFESCItA4rMD5vM_RHt9QzUSALulddRTAtGKexRuWuiBE8tDw_aem_
 vXP_JSWUu1NrAFuKa--PQA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\nDoor will close at th
 e beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIR
 CLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcolle
 ctive.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?f
 bclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExVTF6aExURExqbndxM3JFUHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMj
 AzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR5CSyB7238bGlkEsU_Cg_jsh0446YHLe69W1y3KV5-T6oMaN-7Z3q32
 wDznUA_aem_wUhim1G2JnrnWxIQYKCcIA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Colle
 ctive envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be the
 ir authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to 
 inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by host
 ing dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)
 (3) nonprofit organization.\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
