SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ Guest DJ Karen Funshine
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 15th\nEvening Danc
 e Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nGuest
  DJ Karen Funshine \\| Facilitator Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: Embrace You-Ne
 ss\n“You-Ness” is the essence of you\, a completely unique blend of yo
 ur genetic & astrological blueprint\, your life experiences\, your spirit\
 , talents\, & desires. Within you lives a full spectrum of personalities\,
  from the wounded child to the wise sage\, from the artist to the scientis
 t and so many varied expressions in between. This dance is an invitation t
 o step fully into that multi-dimensional being and welcome all parts of yo
 urself\, raw\, real\, and FREE. Drop the mask of your "usual self" and all
 ow what’s been hidden or suppressed to breathe\, move\, be seen and felt
 \, whether it be the elegant or the profane\, the tender or the fierce\, t
 he serious or the sensual\, the timid or the wild one. There is no bad or 
 wrong part of you. It's all perfect\, whole & complete. Together\, we cele
 brate radical self-acceptance rather than comparison and rediscover the fr
 eedom of being wholly\, unapologetically you. In the words of the great Dr
 . Seuss\, "Today you are You\, that is truer than true. There is no one al
 ive who is Youer than You". So\, let's dive in and get curious about which
  parts of us show up when we invite them into our dance with loving\, open
  arms\, minds\, & hearts.\n\nAbout the DJ\nKaren Funshine (Karen Smith) ha
 s been dancing since age 3\, with movement as her lifelong ally. A veteran
  raver & EDM enthusiast\, she was delighted to discover 5Rhythms and ecsta
 tic dance 10 years ago in Austin - a sober and judgment-free space to get 
 wild & free. She’s since facilitated many women’s conscious dance circ
 les and a vibrant live-instrument dance - weaving music and somatic moveme
 nt to alchemize emotion\, open the heart\, and awaken joy. Recently reloca
 ted to Asheville\, Karen is honored to share her passion and playfulness w
 ith her beautiful new community through the universal language of music an
 d dance.\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm 
 up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will
  be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. 
 \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away
  for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemo
 vementcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective
 .org/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN
 0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC
 5heP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nW
 e need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:
 \n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemo
 vementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzT
 mFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I7
 1UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPOR
 TANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening cir
 cle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective 
 agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://
 ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZB
 ExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8q
 UH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4Y
 AfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that m
 oves in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a l
 oving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healt
 hy community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal a
 nd community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\
 nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor
 !
